        "@value": "Experience the Magic of The Nutcracker The Academy of Classical Ballet & Modern Dances (ABCDM) proudly returns to the historic Capitol Theatre with its acclaimed production of The Nutcracker - a treasured holiday tradition in Moncton since 2011. Step into a world of enchantment as this timeless ..."
