    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Choir! Choir! Choir! is the fully interactive, participatory show that turns audience into performer! So get ready to laugh, dance and SING! your hearts out with hundreds of other music-lovers just like you. It’s like a big birthday party for the greatest songs of all time and you’re invited! So ..."
