    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Great Canadian Comedy Caravan Tour"
      },
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "The Great Canadian Comedy Caravan Tour"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/inLanguage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Canada's comedy treasures, The Great Canadian Comedy Caravan Tour make their highly anticipated first trip ever to Moncton!\r\nPerforming at the Empress Theatre on Saturday April 10, 2027, headlined by host and writer of This Hour Has 22 Minutes, Travis Lindsay, this show will leave you wanting more.\r\nTravis is also a Finalist on Canada's Got Talent with multiple appearances at Just For Laughs, Halifax Comedy Fest, New Wave of Stand Up on CBC GEM and Hubcap Comedy Fest. He's even met Rosa Parks!\r\nTravis will be joined by:Feature Act: Todd Reid (Just For Laughs, SiriusXM and Page International Screenwriting Contest Quarterfinalist)Host: Matt Watson (Just For Laughs, SiriusXM, Glasgow Comedy Festival and Melbourne Comedy Festival)\r\nThe best part of all, this is a benefit show for Ronald McDonald House Maritimes!\r\nGet your tickets before they're gone!\r\nEmpress Theatre (theatre-style seating - general admission)199 Robinson "
      },
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "Les joyaux de l'humour canadien, la tournée The Great Canadian Comedy Caravan, font leur toute première venue très attendue à Moncton !\r\nPrévu le samedi 10 avril 2027 à l'Empress Theatre, avec en tête d'affiche Travis Lindsay, animateur et scénariste de This Hour Has 22 Minutes, ce spectacle vous laissera en redemander.\r\nTravis est également finaliste de Canada's Got Talent et s'est produit à plusieurs reprises au festival Just for Laughs, au Halifax Comedy Fest, dans l'émission New Wave of Stand Up sur CBC GEM, ainsi qu'au Hubcap Comedy Fest. Il a même rencontré Rosa Parks !\r\nTravis sera accompagné de :Tête d’affiche : Todd Reid (Just For Laughs, SiriusXM et quart de finaliste du concours international d’écriture de scénarios Page)Animateur : Matt Watson (Just For Laughs, SiriusXM, Glasgow Comedy Festival et Melbourne Comedy Festival)\r\nEt le meilleur dans tout ça, c’est qu’il s’agit d’un spectacle-bénéfice au profit de la Maison Ronald McDonald des Maritimes !\r\nAchetez vos billets avant qu’il n’y en ait plus !\r\nSalle Empress (places assises de style théâtre - admission générale)199 Robinson "
      }
    ],
