        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Former AHL Moncton Golden Flames Athletic Trainer and longtime NHL Calgary Flames Athletic Trainer turned Standup Comedian Brian Patafie will be coming to The Empress Theatre here in Moncton and he will be bringing his FUNNY AS PUCK Show to the iconic theatre which is part of Moncton's Capitol ..."
