    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Hollywood Hits"
      },
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "Hollywood Hits"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/inLanguage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Experience the Magic of the Movies Like Never Before!\r\nFrom epic adventures and legendary heroes to timeless romances and unforgettable cinematic moments, Hollywood Hits 2027 brings the magic of the silver screen to life through the power of a live symphony orchestra.\r\nExperience the thrilling music of Star Wars, Indiana Jones, Pirates of the Caribbean and The Lord of the Rings, alongside the beautiful melodies of Cinema Paradiso, Breakfast at Tiffany's and other beloved film classics under the baton of maestro Cesar Suarez.\r\nWith soaring strings, powerful brass and music that has defined generations of moviegoing, this spectacular concert celebrates the unforgettable soundtracks that make great movies truly extraordinary.\r\nLights. Camera. Orchestra! "
      },
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "Découvrez la magie du cinéma comme jamais auparavant !\r\nDes aventures épiques aux héros légendaires, en passant par des romances intemporelles et des moments cinématographiques inoubliables, Hollywood Hits 2027 donne vie à la magie du grand écran grâce à la puissance d’un orchestre symphonique en direct.\r\nDécouvrez la musique palpitante de Star Wars, Indiana Jones, Pirates of the Caribbean et The Lord of the Rings, ainsi que les magnifiques mélodies de Cinema Paradiso, Breakfast at Tiffany's et d’autres grands classiques du cinéma, sous la baguette du maestro César Suarez.\r\nAvec des cordes envoûtantes, des cuivres puissants et une musique qui a marqué des générations de cinéphiles, ce concert spectaculaire rend hommage aux bandes originales inoubliables qui rendent les grands films véritablement extraordinaires.\r\nLumières. Caméra. Orchestre ! "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventAttendanceMode": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ]
  },
